| B01 / RW-19–20 | P2-09 (accept), P2-10, P2-11 | TL-1, TL-2, RE-1/2, CORE-1 (voice), CORE-2 (typing), TEST-1, QA-1, REV-1/2 | **принят 2026-10-21** |
